************************************
G1 X Mark II notes
************************************
CHDK is a hack, use at your own risk!

General camera and CHDK port information
****************************************

Port discussion thread https://chdk.setepontos.com/index.php?topic=14228.0

** General
- To start in shooting mode or wifi connect, hold down the corresponding button
- G1 X MkII uses propset 6.

** Buttons
- Default alt button is SHORTCUT. DISPLAY, VIDEO and WIFI may also be used
- The MF button is identified as ERASE in scripting and CHDK shortcuts
- Mobile Device Connection button is identified as WIFI
- "AF frame selector / filtering image display" button is identified as FRAMING ASSIST

Tests & Issues
**************

** Tested
- hooktest.lua
- Tv, Av
- ISO override
- isobase.lua
- CHDK raw / DNG (tested only in P and auto mode, camera already supports RAW in various modes by default, may be broken in some special modes)
- setmode.lua (100ms works)
- motion.lua
- Edge, Zebra, Grid, Histogram, Battery, File overlays
- ND, SD override
- PTP live view & remote shoot
- PTP remote shoot with JPEG, CHDK DNG (Canon RAW didn't work)
- Multipartition boot with FAT16 + exFAT
- Extra long exposures, tested 180s

** Not Tested
- EVF
- USB remote
- HDMI

** Not Implemented
- video controls (movie_rec task) / movie features are not supported

** Known issues

